ne-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270338124068_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270338124068_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/match1869187date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">头名出线！法国4-1挪威 登贝莱戴帽姆巴佩两助攻哈兰德未登场</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260627/zhanbao_image_1869187_1782507488_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260627/zhanbao_image_1869187_1782507488_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260627/zhanbao_image_1869187_1782507488_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>登贝莱帽子戏法，姆巴佩两送助攻，杜埃破门，哈兰德未登场。最终法国4-1战胜挪威，法国头名出线，挪威淘汰赛将迎战科特迪瓦。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/match1869188date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">小组第三暂第5！塞内加尔5-0十人伊拉克 马内造直红盖耶2射1传</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260627/zhanbao_image_1869188_1782507142_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260627/zhanbao_image_1869188_1782507142_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260627/zhanbao_image_1869188_1782507142_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>帕普·盖耶2射1传，塞内加尔队以5-0击败伊拉克队。积分榜方面，塞内加尔队三战积3分排在小组第三，伊拉克队积0分垫底出局。</p><p><strong>【世界杯数据】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/6a3ed15bb2dc0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">金球先生！登贝莱破门32分钟上演帽子戏法，3个进球如出一辙！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270350179488.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270350179488.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270350179488.jpg"> </div><p>挪威vs法国比赛第32分钟，登贝莱戴帽，本届世界杯已经有第三个帽子戏法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/6a3ed83bae9e3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">仅用时32分钟！登贝莱上演世界杯历史第二快帽子戏法</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/6a3ee01f5b8c1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">小组第三积分榜：塞内加尔第5，韩国降至第7，苏格兰暂跌出晋级区</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.53" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3eea118cc24.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.53" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.53" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3eea118cc24.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3eea118cc24.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">塞内加尔5-0大胜十人伊拉克，在所有小组第三球队中暂时排名第5，韩国降至第7，苏格兰暂时跌出晋级区。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/6a3ee016645c7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">维京海盗PK非洲大象！挪威2胜1负小组第2出线 淘汰赛对阵科特迪瓦</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270451242294.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270451242294.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270451242294.jpg"> </div><p>挪威1-4法国，本届世界杯2胜1负，小组第2出线，淘汰赛将战科特迪瓦。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/6a3ee0f04dfb7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">基本确定！法国1/16决赛对阵：96.8%概率对阵瑞典！3.2%对阵G3</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3ed31d77d3d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3ed31d77d3d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/6a3ed31d77d3d.jpg"> </div><p>法国4-1战胜挪威，小组头名晋级世界杯32强，有96.8%的概率在1/16决赛中对阵瑞典。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/6a3eeb6f80032native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">六选四变五选三！塞内加尔大胜超越韩国，韩国出局还需3个条件</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260625/6a3ca9eb89c4f_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260625/6a3ca9eb89c4f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260625/6a3ca9eb89c4f.jpg"> </div><p>塞内加尔5-0大胜伊拉克，将韩国从小组第三排行榜上挤到了第7位。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/6a3ee25e9cf02native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">一路降！韩国在小组第3中已经跌至第7，出线概率从赛后94%跌至50%</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/6a3ef2915c886native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">上届冠亚军！阿根廷与法国淘汰赛不同半区，直到决赛才有可能相遇</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270524541054_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270524541054_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606270524541054_1280.jpg"> </div><p>法国4-1战胜挪威，小组头名晋级世界杯32强。在淘汰赛对阵上，法国进入上半区，与阿根廷分在不同半区中。</p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-27/6a3f020631feanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷已提前出线！斯卡洛尼确认：梅西不会首发出战约旦</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a3975a7776e3_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-rati